From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 19:30:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix: Embed product catalog in system prompt + robust
 without-tools fallback

The AI was returning empty responses because:
1. Groq with tools: model calls search_products tool, tool returns data,
   but model sometimes doesn't generate final text response
2. Google Gemini: free tier quota exhausted (limit: 0)

Fix: Embed the product catalog directly in the system prompt so the AI
can answer product questions WITHOUT needing tool calls to succeed.
If a provider fails with tools, retry WITHOUT tools for guaranteed text.
This makes the AI work reliably even when tool calls fail or quotas are hit.
